+/-- Arity-preserving free-variable relabeling: `mapTermRel` with the identity arity
+function, so no `0 + n` shift/`castLE` bookkeeping ever appears. -/
+def relabelFree (f : α → β) {n : ℕ} : L.BoundedFormula α n → L.BoundedFormula β n :=
+  mapTermRel (fun _ t => t.relabel (Sum.map f id)) (fun _ => id) (fun _ => id)
